      "title": "Clock offset",
      "description": "Seconds this appliance's clock is ahead (positive) of the platform's. A fast gateway stays ONLINE and files every reading early, silently. Past +5 minutes telemetry is discarded; up to a day behind is tolerated. Fixed on the appliance: docs/remote-gateways.md.",
